# The TUF conformance tests the client is expected to fail (ADR 0380).
# `ob test tuf` puts this file beside the client, where the suite reads
# it; a test listed here that passes fails the run. Each has a comment
# above it that says why.

# ML-DSA keys: ring, which checks the client's signatures, has no ML-DSA
# (FIPS 204). Dukovo's repositories sign with Ed25519 and P-256.
test_mldsa_keytype_and_scheme
